<title>@ViewData["Title"] Bracing</title>

@{
    Layout = "_Layout";
    ViewData["FullWidthLayout"] = true;
}

<div class="Teeth-Bracing-hero">
    <div class="overlay text-center">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">Tooth Bracing</h1>
        <p class="lead">Crooked or misaligned teeth can affect not only your appearance, but also your oral health and self-confidence. 
            At DenTeeth, our orthodontic bracing solutions are designed to gradually straighten your teeth, giving you a healthier, more confident smile that lasts a lifetime.</p>
        <p class="lead">Our tooth bracing treatments use precision-engineered brackets and wires to gently shift your teeth into their ideal positions over time. 
            Whether you're dealing with spacing issues, crowding, bite misalignment, or jaw discomfort, our personalized treatment plans are tailored to your unique dental needs.</p>
        <p class="lead">We offer both traditional metal braces and modern clear options for greater comfort and aesthetics — all under the supervision of experienced orthodontic professionals. 
            With regular check-ups and guidance, we ensure every step of your journey is smooth and results-driven.</p>
        <div class="mt-4 d-flex justify-content-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
            <a href="/Appointment/Book" class="btn btn-outline-light px-4">Make Appointment</a>
            <a href="/Home/Index/#Our_Service" class="btn btn-dark px-4">Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>